g Valley (adventure, ₹0 entry, best: morning)\n  - Hadimba Devi Temple (temple, ₹0 entry, best: morning)\n  - Mall Road (shopping, ₹0 entry, best: evening)\n  - Beas River Rafting (adventure, ₹600 entry, best: morning)\n  - Old Manali (culture, ₹0 entry, best: afternoon)\n  - Vashisht Hot Springs (wellness, ₹50 entry, best: morning)\n\nResearch Brief:\nHey there, PariKrama traveler! Get ready for an awesome 5-day budget adventure in the stunning mountains of Manali. Here's your concise brief to make the most of your trip:\n\n---\n\n### Manali Budget Brief: 5-Day Mountain Escape\n\n**1. Weather & Packing / Best Time for Activities**\nGet ready for pleasant summer days in Manali! Daytime temperatures will hover around **29-31°C**, perfect for exploring. However, the advisory is spot on: temperatures drop significantly after sunset, even in summer.\n\n*   **Pack:** Light cotton clothing for days, but *definitely* carry a warm jacket or fleece for evenings. Rain gear (waterproof jacket, umbrella) and waterproof covers for your bags are essential, as summer showers can be unpredictable. Also, be aware that the **monsoon season (June-September)** bring\n\nRecommended Hotel: Backpacker's Inn Manali (₹650/night, rating: 3.8)\nRecommended Transport: bus (₹650, 14 hrs)\n\nBudget Breakdown: Transport ₹1,300, Hotel ₹2,600, Food ₹2,850, Activities ₹750"}], 'model': 'llama-3.3-70b-versatile', 'max_tokens': 8192, 'temperature': 0.7}}
