i, 5 days\nBudget: ₹15,000 for 2 traveler(s)\nStyle: mid\nInterests: trekking, mountains\n\nWeather: Day 1: 36.0-36.7C, Day 2: 29.2-29.2C, Day 3: 29.4-29.4C, Day 4: 29.5-29.5C, Day 5: 29.9-29.9C\nAdvisory: Pleasant temperatures — light cotton clothing is fine; temperatures drop sharply after sunset even in summer — always carry a jacket.\n\nTop Places:\n  - Rohtang Pass (scenic, ₹550 entry, best: morning)\n  - Solang Valley (adventure, ₹0 entry, best: morning)\n  - Hadimba Devi Temple (temple, ₹0 entry, best: morning)\n  - Mall Road (shopping, ₹0 entry, best: evening)\n  - Beas River Rafting (adventure, ₹600 entry, best: morning)\n  - Old Manali (culture, ₹0 entry, best: afternoon)\n  - Vashisht Hot Springs (wellness, ₹50 entry, best: morning)\n\nResearch Brief:\nHere's your research brief for a 5-day trip to Manali, designed to be practical and actionable for a mid-range budget!\n\n---\n\n**PariKrama Research Brief: Manali - 5-Day Mid-Budget Adventure**\n\nHey Explorer! Get ready for an amazing 5-day escape to Manali, where adventure meets serene beauty. Here’s your essential brief to make the most of your trip:\n\n**1. Weather & What to Pack**\nYour trip falls during a warmer period for Manali, with daytime temperatures ranging from **29°C to 36°C**. This means pleasant conditions for outdoor activities, but it’s still Manali! Even in summer, temperatures drop sharply after sunset.\n*   **Pack:** Light cotton clothing, t-shirts, and comfortable walking shoes are perfect for the day. **Crucially, always carry a light jacket, fleece, or shawl** for the eveni\n\nHotel Options (choose the best fit for each night):\n  - Manali Meadows Hostel (hostel, ₹500/night, rating: 3.8, location: Near Mall Road)\n  - Solang Valley Inn (3_star, ₹2,200/night, rating: 4.5, location: Solang Valley)\nRecommended Transport: bus (₹650, 14 hrs)\n\nBudget Breakdown: Transport ₹4,500, Hotel ₹5,250, Food ₹3,000, Activities ₹1,500\nSavings Tips: Book transport in advance; Choose budget guesthouses over hotels"}], 'model': 'llama-3.3-70b-versatile', 'max_tokens': 8192, 'temperature': 0.7}}
